Quest 584 "[Legless Devil] Effective Method"
    Journal for karus "You must help [Priest] Minerva at Luferson Castle."
    Journal for elmorad "You must help [Priest] Minerva at El Morad Castle."
    Collect 2 of 379006000
    Collect 10 of 389014000

Requires player level >= 66 and quest 583 is completed

Rewards
    Give 250000 experience
    Give 1 of 910236000

On available
    Say "Could she have found the ingredients? We are in a hurry so go talk to [Priest]Minerva once again."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "You have come at last <selfname>."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Now I'm not the material remaining in the church. Donations are reduced lately saw this phenomenon. After all the ingredients need to be bought by <selfname> [holy water of salvation] we will produce.\n\nLuferson Castle [Governor] conversation with Minerva."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You have come at last <selfname>."
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Now I'm not the material remaining in the church. Donations are reduced lately saw this phenomenon. After all the ingredients need to be bought by <selfname> [holy water of salvation] we will produce.\n\n[Governor] Minerva of El Morad Castle dialog."

On in_progress
    Say "Material lacks. Insufficient material can not create the holy water."

On claimable
    Show quest "I've collected all the materials! Wait a minute and I'll be right."

On completed
    Say "We've delivered the holy water of salvation. Now worry about the epidemic can release the worries. Badalona large land base site that securely deliver thank you."
